Step 3 – Create Message Types

Create

src/types/messages.ts
export interface ChatRequest {
  type: "ASK_AI";
  prompt: string;
}

export interface ChatResponse {
  success: boolean;
  response: string;
}

Why?

Instead of sending random objects,

{
   hello:123,
   abc:"xyz"
}

we define a contract.

This is much safer.

