Common Errors
Error 1
chrome is not defined

Cause:

Running the React app using npm run dev in the browser instead of loading it as a Chrome extension.

Solution:

Build the project and load the generated dist/ folder as an unpacked extension.

Error 2
Could not establish connection

Cause:

The background service worker isn't registered or has crashed.

Check:

manifest.json
Service Worker console
Build output
Error 3
Receiving end does not exist

Cause:

The extension wasn't reloaded after rebuilding.

Solution:

Run npm run build
Go to chrome://extensions
Click Reload on your extension
