What we'll do in Milestone 5

Once this milestone is complete, we'll move to Content Scripts, where we'll:

Inject a floating 🤖 Ask DevPilot AI button into every webpage
Read selected text using window.getSelection()
Send selected text to the Background Service Worker
Display a small in-page UI
Prepare the flow for connecting to the backend and AI in later chapters

By the end of Milestone 5, your extension will be able to interact directly with web pages, which is the foundation for features like Explain Code, Summarize Page, Translate Selection, and Ask DevPilot AI.